{meta: melody Alouette}

{start_of_chorus}
Alouette, little alouette
Alouette now I still love you
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse}
{comment: Voorzanger zingt voor, allen herhalen}
And now I love you strawly hair
And now I love you strawly hair
strawly hair
strawly hair
Alouette
Alouette, Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaah...........
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{comment: Herhaal het couplet telkens met het volgende:}

{start_of_verse}
crossed eyes
bumpy nose
sailing ears
bubbling lips
iron skin
big big mouth
rubber skin
wooden chest
hanging tits
awfull well
long long neck
stooney teeth
funny breast
stinking feet
rotten tooth
sweet sweet smile
{end_of_verse}

{comment: enz.}
